This commit introduces a comprehensive suite of unit tests for the PSF
(PC Screen Font) parser and the builtin VGA font initialization logic.

New test cases include:
- test_font_init_builtin: Verifies correct initialization of font metrics.
- test_font_get_glyph: Checks glyph data retrieval and bounds checking.
- test_psf1_parse_basic: Tests PSF1 header parsing and metrics.
- test_psf2_parse_basic: Tests PSF2 header parsing and metrics.
- test_psf_parse_dispatch: Verifies the auto-detection of font formats.

The tests are integrated into the central test runner and supported by
the host test build system.

